    "0.7.2 Prompt, strict JSON schema and parsing: the model returns only word IDs and a confidence per field, and our code builds each value by joining those words' OCR text, so the model cannot correct a misread; field confidence is the lowest OCR confidence of the cited words (Option A), with the model's own confidence kept in details only; flag texts are always ours; response checked against the schema and against the OCR words; one retry on invalid output, then needs-review with every field null and flagged. Tests use recorded responses only. (R3.1, R3.2)": [
